    {
      "from": "DET R.J. Burgess",
      "time": "2:47 PM",
      "text": "Ha! Now that could be a very good thing, or a very bad thing!"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET R.J. Burgess",
      "time": "2:47 PM",
      "text": "Seeing how scherzer delivery is pretty much one of a kind"
